{{user_prompt}}

{{#if context}}
Context:
{{context}}
{{/if}}

{{#if template}}
Template to follow:
{{template}}
{{/if}}

Requirements:
- Use proper heading hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)
- Use consistent list markers (- or 1.)
- Use fenced code blocks with language identifiers
- Ensure all links are valid (relative or absolute)
- No trailing spaces
- Maximum line length 120 characters (soft limit)
- Include front matter if document appears to be a standalone article

Generate only the Markdown content, no additional explanation.